        },
        {
          "text": " Hata ikawa baada ya siku nyingi, BWANA alipokuwa amekwisha kuwapa Israeli amani mbele ya adui zao pande zote, naye Yoshua alipokuwa mzee, mwenye miaka mingi sana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
