              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 28:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yoshua akawaita Israeli wote, wazee wao, na wakuu wao, na waamuzi wao, na makamanda wao, akawaambia, Mimi ni mzee, nami nimezeeka sana; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nanyi mmeona mambo yote ambayo BWANA, Mungu wenu, amewatenda mataifa haya yote kwa ajili yenu; kwa maana BWANA, Mungu wenu, ndiye aliyewapigania ninyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tazama, nimewagawieni kwa kura mataifa haya yaliyobaki, yawe urithi kwa makabila yenu, toka mto wa Yordani, pamoja na mataifa yote niliyowakatilia mbali, mpaka bahari kubwa upande wa magharibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
