        {
          "text": " Yeye BWANA, Mungu wenu, atawatoa kwa nguvu mbele yenu, atawafukuza wasiwe mbele ya macho yenu tena; nanyi mtaimiliki nchi yao, kama BWANA Mungu wenu, alivyowaambia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
